  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Striking with both of your weapons simultaneously, you can use them to deliver devastating wounds.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Dex 17, Double Slice, Improved Two-Weapon Fighting, Two-Weapon Fighting, base attack bonus +11.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> If you hit an opponent with both your primary hand and your off-hand weapon, you deal an additional 1d10 points of damage plus 1-1/2 times your Strength modifier. You can only deal this additional damage once each round.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/practitioner-feats#toc103\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
